stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> FirstPressed: Debounced press
    FirstPressed --> WaitingSecond: Release after hold shorter than 500 ms
    FirstPressed --> Lockout: Release after hold at least 500 ms / single action
    WaitingSecond --> SecondPressed: Debounced second press / double action
    WaitingSecond --> Lockout: 350 ms elapsed without second press / single action
    SecondPressed --> Lockout: Debounced release
    Lockout --> Idle: Released for 200 ms
    Lockout --> Lockout: Pressed / refresh cooldown, ignore action
    note right of Idle
        Separate FSMs for PE5 and PE6.
        Input debounce is 50 ms.
        PE4 and PA0 use press-edge handling,
        not this multi-click FSM.
    end note
